WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.900
We are running some major promotions

00:01.900 --> 00:03.410
for the month of November,

00:03.410 --> 00:04.550
some Black Friday stuff.

00:04.550 --> 00:05.340
My name is Chloe.

00:05.340 --> 00:07.100
I'm coming to you here from Alkimi Jiu-Jitsu.

00:07.100 --> 00:08.500
We have two different options.

00:08.500 --> 00:09.370
Option one is if you want

00:09.370 --> 00:10.160
to start immediately

00:10.160 --> 00:11.880
and get on the mats tomorrow,

00:11.880 --> 00:13.510
you can hop in today

00:13.510 --> 00:14.210
and save

00:14.210 --> 00:15.760
with our severely discounted

00:15.760 --> 00:16.570
membership rates.

00:16.570 --> 00:17.440
Option number two,

00:17.440 --> 00:19.417
if you have a busy holiday season

00:19.417 --> 00:20.770
and can't start training

00:20.770 --> 00:22.560
regularly until the new year,

00:22.560 --> 00:24.120
you can put a deposit down today

00:24.120 --> 00:25.370
and lock in the rates

00:25.370 --> 00:26.580
and start your new year

00:26.580 --> 00:28.010
strong in 2027.

00:28.010 --> 00:29.300
See you guys on the mats.
